# This is an npm-workspaces project (see root package.json's "workspaces")
# -- package-lock.json is the single source of truth for reproducible
# installs (`npm ci`, used by every Dockerfile and any future CI) and must
# be committed. It was gitignored from Phase 1 onward, alongside the other
# package managers' lockfiles below, which this project has never used.
